<Layout title="Privacy & Call Tracking | We Pay Probate" description="How this website handles phone links and optional analytics.">
<main id="main" class="wrap section policy"><p class="eyebrow">WE PAY PROBATE</p><h1>Privacy & call tracking</h1><p>This website provides information and links to call We Pay Probate. It does not currently collect information through a contact form.</p><h2>Phone calls</h2><p>Clicking a call link opens your device’s phone application. Information you share on a call is provided to the business, rather than collected by this website. Ask the business about how it handles that information before sharing sensitive details.</p><h2>Website analytics</h2><p>The site includes support for optional Google Analytics. When configured, analytics can measure page visits and clicks on phone links. A phone-link click does not establish that a call connected. Event data includes the page path and button location, rather than what you discuss on a call. Google Analytics may use cookies and process device and usage information.</p><h2>Call recording</h2><p>This website does not itself record calls or implement a call-tracking service. Any future call tracking or recording requires an updated disclosure and appropriate consent arrangements.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>For questions about information handling, call <a href="tel:+19543206336" data-call-location="privacy">954-320-6336</a>.</p></main>
</Layout>
